  "Rooms": [
    {
      "Id": 7900,
      "Name": "Outside Redferne's residence",
      "Description": "\n   A huge cloud forms the plateau on which you are now standing. The wind here\nis absolutely quiet and the sun is shining warmly upon you. From under the\ncloud you can hear the faint sounds of Midgaard. Right before you to the north\nlies the grand Mansion of Naris, the residence of the Greater God Redferne.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Inside",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob",
        "Private"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "North",
          "TargetId": 7901,
          "Description": "You see a HUGE arched gate leading into this magnificent building.",
          "Keywords": [
            "gate",
            "door",
            "huge",
            "arched"
          ],
          "ExitFlags": [
            "Closed"
          ],
          "KeyId": 7901
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Down",
          "TargetId": 7918,
          "Description": "You see a Huge Chain that anchors the Mansion of Naris to the ground.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7901,
      "Name": "The Southern end of the hall",
      "Description": "\n   You are standing in a vast hall that is dimly lit, but from where the light\ncomes, is a mystery. The walls seem to radiate warmth and give the pleasant\nfeeling of being welcome here. A large portrait is hanging on one of the walls.\nA large wooden staircase leads up into the tower. To the east there is a high\npassage away from the hall. This ends shortly after by a tall oak door. The\nenormous hall extends further north from here. To the south you can see a huge,\nand VERY heavy- looking iron-wrought door. It looks like this is the only exit\nfrom this magnificent old house. To the west you can see a large ashen door.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Inside",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob",
        "Indoors",
        "Private"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "North",
          "TargetId": 7904,
          "Description": "The hallway continues that way. You can see more doorways under the wooden\nstaircase in that direction.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "East",
          "TargetId": 7910,
          "Description": "You see there a tall oak door. It looks quite tightly closed to you. On it\nlittle runes are chiseled into the wood.",
          "Keywords": [
            "oak",
            "tall",
            "east",
            "oakdoor",
            "talldoor",
            "eastdoor"
          ],
          "ExitFlags": [
            "Closed"
          ],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "South",
          "TargetId": 7900,
          "Description": "Here you see a REAL door. It would be more proper to call this a \"GATE\", rather\nthan a \"door\". It's really HUGE! On it hangs a large sign with very large\nletters spelling : \"EMERGENCY EXIT\".",
          "Keywords": [
            "gate",
            "south",
            "exit",
            "iron",
            "huge",
            "emergency"
          ],
          "ExitFlags": [
            "Closed"
          ],
          "KeyId": 7901
        },
        {
          "Direction": "West",
          "TargetId": 7902,
          "Description": "This looks like a \"door\" in the meaning of the word. The ashen wood is painted\nin a peculiar yellow color. Small letters are written with black on it.",
          "Keywords": [
            "ashen",
            "ash",
            "door",
            "west",
            "yellow"
          ],
          "ExitFlags": [
            "Closed"
          ],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Up",
          "TargetId": 7909,
          "Description": "You see the staircase extending upwards into the very high tower. It ends in\nwhat seems like a large bedroom up there.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "runes"
          ],
          "Description": "\nThese runes are utterly strange to you, but you are in luck today: Under\nthe runes you can just make out a sentence in Common.  It goes : \" Stay out,\nif you treasure your life.  That is if you are mortal.\"."
        },
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "letters"
          ],
          "Description": "\nThey read \"LIBRARY\"."
        }
      ],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7902,
      "Name": "Redferne's Library",
      "Description": "\n   This is truly a magnificent place! Books and scrolls lie together on every\nshelf. A large globe, with the map of the Mud-world upon it, stands in the\ndimly lit north-western corner of the room. Two large and comfortable- looking\nleather arm-chairs adorn the center of the library together with a huge oak\ndesk. Dim light radiates from an enormous crystal chandelier hanging down from\nthe ceiling approximately 10 feet off the floor. To the east there is a great\nold ashen door. A large glass window is set in the west wall.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Inside",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob",
        "Indoors",
        "Private"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "East",
          "TargetId": 7901,
          "Description": "You can see an old ashen door, painted in a peculiar yellow color.",
          "Keywords": [
            "door",
            "ash",
            "ashen",
            "east"
          ],
          "ExitFlags": [
            "Closed"
          ],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "globe",
            "world",
            "map"
          ],
          "Description": "\nYou see a large world map stretch out on the enormous globe.  It has towns\ndrawn in every spot available for such.  In the middle of the map you can\nspot a large town with the name 'MIDGAARD' written over it.  The rest is\nmountains, woods, plains and water."
        },
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "midgaard",
            "town",
            "city"
          ],
          "Description": "\nYou see a small speck with woods on the west from it, plains to the east\nfrom it and mountains to the north from it.  To the south from it you can\nsee a thin trail lead to a large castle.  Finally you notice a rather large\nriver pour in from the east and go through Midgaard in the middle."
        },
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "chairs",
            "leather",
            "arm-chairs"
          ],
          "Description": "\nThese two chair are exactly alike one another.  They look incredibly\ncomfortable.  They're both made from old leather, and yet they seem so worn\nthat they can be nothing but a perfect place for a long needed rest."
        },
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "window",
            "glass"
          ],
          "Description": "\nThese windows are really BIG!  They reach from about 20 inches above the\nfloor to approximately 10 inches under the ceiling.  If you try and\n\"look out\", you might see what might lie beyond these windows."
        },
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "out",
            "outside",
            "beyond"
          ],
          "Description": "\nThe clouds muster and form the ground on which this entire building is set.\nThrough the thinnest of the clouds you can just make out MIDGAARD with all\nit's magnificent activity."
        },
        {
          "Keywords": [
            "river"
          ],
          "Description": "\nYou see a large and winding river cut through the landscape, starting at an\nenormous inland lake, it seeps through Midgaard and finally ends up in the\nGrand Sea on the West-coast of the land."
        }
      ],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7903,
      "Name": "The Artifact room of Naris",
      "Description": "\n   This is gloomy and dark room with only a faint light radiating from the\nwalls. A bunch of funny-looking items fill the center of the room. There are no\nfurniture here what-so-ever. The only way out seems to be west, through the low\nsteel door.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Inside",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob",
        "Indoors",
        "Private"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "West",
