    },
    {
      "Id": 7906,
      "Name": "The Kitchen of Naris",
      "Description": "\n   This must be the place of food and drink. You can hear the faint noise of\nrats feasting on meat and bread from somewhere indeterminable. The sound makes\nyou feel the agony of HUNGER. The only visible exit is south to the Northern\nend of the hall.",
