    {
      "Id": 7911,
      "Name": "Redferne's Bedroom",
      "Description": "\n   This is a snugly set bedroom with all the necessities for a romantic\nevening. A large fireplace adorns the east wall, and sizzling away is the wood\nthat is ablaze within. The bed is enormous, covering at least HALF of this\ngreat room. This stretches at least 140 square feet, so can you imagine the\nBED? A large staircase leads down to the hall. A couple of doors open up to a\nbroad balcony to the south.",
