    {
      "Id": 7912,
      "Name": "The Balcony of Redferne's Residence",
      "Description": "\n   You see a splendid of the most of this world. The valleys stretch as far as\nthe eye reaches to the south from here. Down below you can see the entrance of\nthis magnificent building. To the north are the doors to Redferne's Bedroom.",
