    {
      "Id": 7913,
      "Name": "The Monster Pen",
      "Description": "\n   This looks like the cage in which a large carnivore is being kept. Judging\nby the state the walls are in, this could very well be a large AGGRESSIVE\nanimal. This makes you pretty insecure, this stating your feeling about the\nplace quite mildly.",
