    {
      "Id": 7914,
      "Name": "On the Huge Chain",
      "Description": "\n   This place has quite a good view over Midgaard. Your possibilities of\nmovement seems to extend only to up and down. Unless you want to let go of the\nsecure and seemingly unmovable chain, then those are the directions you should\ntake from here.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Mountain",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "Up",
          "TargetId": 7915,
          "Description": "Up the way you see the chain disappearing into the clouds above.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Down",
          "TargetId": 3120,
          "Description": "Down below you see the huge chain anchored to the ground in the Road Crossing.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7915,
      "Name": "The Chain where it's too windy",
      "Description": "\n   Hanging on to the chain you figure out that there's no way of leaving down\nfrom here. The wind pulls you from left to right and back. This seems like a\ntotally impossible task. The ascend is the only way ahead for you. Otherwise\nyou would risk death by falling to the hard ground below. DO NOT DESCEND NOW OR\nYOU'LL SURELY DIE!!!!",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Mountain",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "Up",
          "TargetId": 7916,
          "Description": "That way seems to be the only way away from here.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Down",
          "TargetId": 7920,
          "Description": "THAT WAY IS CERTAIN DEATH!!!! You can see the wind tearing at the chain down\nbelow you. It swings like a furious serpent from side to side! The descend is\nABSOLUTELY out of the QUESTION.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7916,
      "Name": "On the Great Chain of Naris",
      "Description": "\n   You are approximately on the middle of the treacherous Chain. One false step\nand death will come and collect you quickly. The chain leads upwards and down.\nNo way are you going to descend now... You've only just begun your climb.\nBesides it could cost you your life. Look down and you'll see why.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Mountain",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "Up",
          "TargetId": 7918,
          "Description": "There seems to be only one way from here and that's up.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Down",
          "TargetId": 7915,
          "Description": "The chain down there is swinging wildly back and forth. Going down there will\nbe pretty risky!",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7917,
      "Name": "The Chain",
      "Description": "\n   As you descend, the chain seems to absorb all weather around it, making it\nswing less and less in the very powerful wind tearing at it. The Chain seems to\nchuckle quietly, and as you descend further you hear a soft whisper originating\nfrom within the Chain *ITSELF*. It says, \" Welcome back some other time,\nstranger. Your company is always ... hmmm ... interesting. God Speed. \" The\nchain extends further down through the now spreading clouds.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Mountain",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "Up",
          "TargetId": -1,
          "Description": "It seems to you that the Chain is dissolving again. Maybe it's just an\nillusion, but still ... !",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Down",
          "TargetId": 7914,
          "Description": "That way seems safe enough ... now.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7918,
      "Name": "The Mighty Chain of Naris",
      "Description": "\n   This place truly a splendid view of the WHOLE COUNTRY SIDE!!! A magnificent\nlight shines upon you and the way up through the clouds is opened. Up there you\ncan now see the Mansion of Naris, Residence of the Greater God Redferne. The\nchain beneath you seems to evaporate in the mustering clouds that surround you\nby now.",
      "ZoneId": 79,
      "Sector": "Mountain",
      "Flags": [
        "NoMob"
      ],
      "Exits": [
        {
          "Direction": "Up",
          "TargetId": 7900,
          "Description": "You see the sunny top of the clouds. Beyond these, the Mansion towers before\nyour eyes. Beautiful!!",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        },
        {
          "Direction": "Down",
          "TargetId": 7917,
          "Description": "You see nothing but the thick clouds. They've closed completely around the\nChain.",
          "Keywords": [],
          "ExitFlags": [],
          "KeyId": null
        }
      ],
      "ExtraDescriptions": [],
      "SpecialProc": null,
      "RoomPrograms": [],
      "CrashRoom": false
    },
    {
      "Id": 7920,
      "Name": "Free fall from the Chain",
      "Description": "\n   This is probably the third worst place to be in this entire MUD right now.\nYou fall . . . and fall . . . and fall . . . and HIT THE GROUND WITH SUCH A\n*SPLUTCH* that you die horribly, but instantly. Bye Cruel World. You lose all\nyour things immediately, Sorry!!",
      "ZoneId": 79,
